B.bqz=new A.u("1. Prefer calm conditions with small, regular rolls. Waves, manoeuvring and active stabilisation can distort the measured period. Use the vessel-specific method where available.\n\n2. Tap Start at a clearly identified maximum heel on one side.\n\n3. One full cycle: from that side, through the opposite side, back to the same maximum heel. Side-to-opposite-side is only half a cycle.\n\n4. Tap Stop & Use immediately on the first return to maximum heel on the starting side, after passing through the opposite side. Measure exactly ONE complete cycle.\n\n5. The measured time is your roll period T. You can also enter one complete roll period manually. Do not enter the total time for several cycles.\n\n6. If checking again, measure a new single cycle. Irregular rolling and button timing errors make this approximate estimate less reliable.\n\nIf the app loses focus or the phone locks during timing, start a new measurement.",null,B.eA,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
